      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURNING KUNA (2) collided in the run and missed the frame when sixth (23.10) at Mandurah over 400m in a Grade 5/6. Better than latest and well worth another try. JAYDE MCCOOL (1) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 2.5 lengths back in second (22.23) at this track in a LS6 over 381m. Expected to feature. CROCODILE CRAWL (7) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when third (16.59) at this track. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Overdue and gets his chance. THIS BAD BOY (5) cannot be left out after placing here at this trip last start.",
